      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name} Thanks for the reply. This sounds pretty much like exactly what I was looking for, since some avatars don't work too well with the new finger poses since they were made with the old ones in mind, meanwhile it's just fine or even better with others.",
