  "details": "Now in the beta when we get the skeletal input we get a really weird splay on the fingers. At least while using index controllers. Looks a bit like you injured your little finger. Would be nice if you could align up your fingers again somehow. The thumb is way better than it has been. So no real complaints there.\n\nFully aware that you could probably fix this up in unity with editing muscle settings on your avatars hands. But that feels like a big ask for all the current avatars out there.",
